<view class="page">
  <view class="kicker">大圣Vlog体验版</view>
  <view class="title">故事已经有样子了。</view>
  <view class="status-card">
    <view class="status-row"><text>{{statusText}}</text><text>{{progress}}%</text></view>
    <view class="bar"><view class="fill" style="width:{{progress}}%"></view></view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{videoUrl}}" class="video-card">
    <video class="video-player" src="{{videoUrl}}" controls object-fit="cover" poster="" show-center-play-btn></video>
    <view class="video-note">真实生成成片 · {{provider}}</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{needsReference}}" class="hint-card">
    <text class="hint-title">成片链路已就绪</text>
    <text class="hint-copy">当前还缺一张可公网访问的首帧海报。海报生成成功后，系统会自动把它送入大圣Vlog视频模型。</text>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{failed}}" class="hint-card warning">
    <text class="hint-title">这次生成没成功</text>
    <text class="hint-copy">导演稿和故事核已经保留，不让桃农重新填写资料。后续可直接再次生成视频。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="script-card">
    <text class="script-title">《{{story.title}}》</text>
    <view class="shot"><text class="time">0-4s</text><text class="shot-title">开场钩子</text><text class="copy">自拍杆轻晃。大圣边走边说：老朋友，今天不赶路，陪俺看看这桃熟了没有。</text></view>
    <view class="shot"><text class="time">4-14s</text><text class="shot-title">真实发现</text><text class="copy">大圣走到桃树前，先闻一闻，忍不住摘下一颗：咳，这不是偷吃，这是专业鉴定。</text></view>
    <view class="shot"><text class="time">14-24s</text><text class="shot-title">桃农入场</text><text class="copy">大圣把镜头转给桃农，一问一答，讲这片桃园为什么值得被看见。</text></view>
    <view class="shot"><text class="time">24-27s</text><text class="shot-title">情绪落点</text><text class="copy">{{story.slogan}}</text></view>
    <view class="shot final"><text class="time">27-30s</text><text class="shot-title">统一片尾</text><text class="copy">桃紫有光 LOGO + 招新二维码 + “扫一扫，让大圣发现你的故事”。</text></view>
  </view>

  <view class="platforms">
    <view><text class="platform">抖音</text><text class="platform-copy">{{platformCopy.douyin || '退休后的蟠桃园长，为什么跑到平谷来了？'}}</text></view>
    <view><text class="platform">小红书</text><text class="platform-copy">{{platformCopy.xiaohongshu || '今天跟着大圣去桃园里慢了一会儿。'}}</text></view>
  </view>

  <button class="primary" bindtap="restart">再讲一个故事</button>
</view>